1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:49,079
First Army, 3,800 men.

17
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:50,600
Second Army, 2,600 men.

18
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,399
Third Army, 3,700 men.

19
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,320
After the reorganization,

20
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,399
Yang and Qin's troops are back in place.

21
00:00:55,679 --> 00:00:57,159
That concludes today's military report.

22
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:59,079
What about the equipment we ordered?

23
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,920
It's already on the way.

24
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:02,799
It'll reach Fancheng within three days.

25
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,439
Three days from now,

26
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,599
I'll go with you to receive it.

27
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,439
Yes.

28
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,640
Once the equipment arrives,

29
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,359
it'll be time for something else too.

30
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,960
=Episode 24=

31
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:41,560
The gun in my hand

32
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:44,400
is part of the latest arms
bought with Lu family gold bars.

33
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,079
With weapons like this,

34
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:51,159
the Lu Army will be invincible.

35
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,120
But today,

36
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,200
I'll use it first

37
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:59,159
to send you to answer to my mother

38
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:03,159
and every innocent soul you killed.

39
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,319
Back then,

40
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:39,759
you put four bullets into my mother.

41
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,840
Today, I'm returning all four.

42
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:51,280
(Memorial Tablets of the 12 Concubines)

43
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,400
Burn it.

44
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:06,520
Burn every bit of this poison.

45
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,039
Every batch we burn
means one less batch out there.

46
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:12,560
If only we could burn
all the opium in the world.

47
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,520
You've already done so much.

48
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,080
If it weren't for you,

49
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:20,479
this opium would've flooded Fancheng.

50
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,840
Think how many would've died.

51
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,080
Staff Officer Chen is right.

52
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:27,120
Commander He.

53
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,479
You've already done so much.

54
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:32,400
Report.

55
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,000
Commander He, Ms. Lu.

56
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,919
All the opium has been destroyed.

57
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,639
Good.

58
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,320
(Memorial Tablet of Lin Mei)

59
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:00,120
(My Late Mother, Cheng Mei)

60
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,920
(Memorial Tablet of Lin Kefu)

61
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,960
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

62
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:09,320
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

63
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:15,280
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

64
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,319
♪Mock me, trample my old wounds♪

65
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,120
Mother.

66
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:20,920
I'm sure that in heaven,

67
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:23,480
you've reunited with
the Second Concubine and her daughter.

68
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,079
Kefu.

69
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,480
I've finally avenged you.

70
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:31,560
Please let me remain here in your name,

71
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,519
using the wealth and arms
of the Governor's Residence

72
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:36,040
to protect the people of Fancheng

73
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:39,399
and countless orphaned children like us.

74
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,600
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

75
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,319
At ease!

76
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,279
Attention!

77
00:04:51,639 --> 00:04:52,759
Troops of Fancheng!

78
00:04:52,759 --> 00:04:56,399
Commander He, Ms. Lu,
Staff Officer Chen, inspect the troops!

79
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,040
Effective today,

80
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:01,160
the Lu Army is now the Fancheng Army.

81
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,079
Stand solemnly!

82
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,800
(Fancheng)

83
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,280
(Loyalty Eternal)

84
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,480
Uncles and elders,

85
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,759
it's clear you still don't trust me

86
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,560
to run the Lu Chamber of Commerce.

87
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,199
Otherwise, you wouldn't all be here
pressuring me to take a husband.

88
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,759
Ms. Lu, that's not quite right.

89
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:43,120
This time, I must speak for the clan.

90
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:46,079
We're eager to find you a husband

91
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,240
not because we distrust you.

92
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:50,199
Quite the opposite.

93
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:52,759
We want you to bring greater honor
to the Lu family.

94
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,560
Please understand, Ms. Lu.

95
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:57,240
The Lu clan controls Fancheng

96
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,839
because we've always had
the army behind us.

97
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:03,120
But now the Lu Army no longer
bears the Lu name.

98
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:06,560
How could we not worry?

99
00:06:07,399 --> 00:06:09,319
It's just a name change.

100
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,240
All major military affairs

101
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,680
are still under Commander He's control.

102
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:17,519
Haven't you always trusted him?

103
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:19,800
Exactly.

104
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:24,079
That's why we respectfully ask you

105
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,879
to take Commander He as your husband,

106
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,240
so military power stays in the family

107
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:31,720
and Lu Army and Lu Chamber of Commerce

108
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,480
can continue to support each other.

109
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:38,199
Please take Commander He as your husband

110
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:40,160
and preserve the Lu family's legacy.

111
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:54,399
Since all of you insist,

112
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,040
for the Lu family,

113
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,959
a little sacrifice is nothing.

114
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,240
♪The fairy-tale book beneath my pillow♪

115
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:19,720
♪A happiness secretly tucked away♪

116
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:24,840
♪What did my younger self long to say?♪

117
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:27,520
♪A fawn lost deep within the woods♪

118
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,160
♪Will it ever meet a witch?♪

119
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:33,960
♪And so the story begins♪

120
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,760
♪Starlight parts the mysterious mist♪

121
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,440
♪On tiptoe, I twirl into a dance♪

122
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:42,040
Groom.

123
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,800
Do you take this woman
to be your lawful wedded wife?

124
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,480
♪Moonlight whispers to plants outside♪

125
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,800
From this day forward,

126
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,160
for better or worse,

127
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,360
in sickness and in health,

128
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,680
for richer or poorer,

129
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,519
will you love her,

130
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,319
care for her,

131
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,199
respect her,

132
00:07:55,199 --> 00:07:55,879
accept her,

133
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,560
and remain faithful to her

134
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,120
until the end of your life?

135
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,000
I do.

136
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:02,879
Bride.

137
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:06,240
Do you take this man

138
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,800
to be your lawful wedded husband?

139
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,439
From this day forward,

140
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:11,000
for better or worse,

141
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,600
in sickness and in health...

142
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,959
What's so great about a Western wedding?

143
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,600
I really don't understand.

144
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,480
I heard it was Ms. Lu's wish.

145
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:21,360
Commander He arranged it just for her.

146
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:23,120
Until the end of your life.

147
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:25,040
Do you?

148
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,639
I do.

149
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,519
Groom.

150
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,639
You may now kiss your beautiful bride.

151
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,360
♪The fairy-tale book beneath my pillow♪

152
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,840
♪A happiness secretly tucked away♪

153
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:46,960
♪What did my younger self long to say?♪

154
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:49,640
♪A fawn lost deep within the woods♪

155
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,280
♪Will it ever meet a witch?♪

156
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:56,280
♪And so the story begins♪

157
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:59,720
♪You're the princess in that fairy tale♪

158
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:02,200
♪Standing in the light♪

159
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:05,080
♪I turn away behind a splendid mask♪

160
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:07,360
♪And hide inside my black suit♪

161
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:10,120
♪Dance with me while the fairy tale♪

162
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,680
♪Is not yet over♪

163
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:17,720
♪At dawn, let all return to normal♪

164
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:20,600
(They're perfect together.)

165
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:27,160
(Six Months Later)

166
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,120
He Jingchen.

167
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,000
What are you looking at?

168
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,600
Why do you still have this photo?

169
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,240
Give it to me.

170
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:57,919
I think you look beautiful in it.

171
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,320
I haven't settled the score
with you yet.

172
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:05,519
I only heard about it a few days ago.

173
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:07,080
Back then,

174
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,799
when those old men suggested
you marry me,

175
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,080
what did you say?

176
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:13,519
I...

177
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,039
What did I say?

178
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,639
Still playing dumb?

179
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:21,600
You said, for the family's sake,

180
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:24,200
a little sacrifice was nothing.

181
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,879
So marrying me was a sacrifice?

182
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,020
Oh, come on.

183
00:10:29,799 --> 00:10:32,320
I was just trying to win them over.

184
00:10:33,279 --> 00:10:34,200
Listen to you.

185
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,759
You really got the best of both worlds.

186
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,799
Miss.

187
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:45,240
Miss, a letter for you.

188
00:10:49,639 --> 00:10:50,360
Miss.

189
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,120
It's from Lancheng.

190
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,440
Lancheng?

191
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:54,960
That's my letter.

192
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,000
I know it's your letter.

193
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,240
I'll open it for you.

194
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,639
I don't need your help. Give it back.

195
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,519
Give it back. I'll read it myself.

196
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:09,480
No need.

197
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,720
There's nothing worth reading.

198
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,679
It says

199
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:16,279
after Rong Muxian returned to Lancheng,

200
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:17,919
he gave it some thought

201
00:11:18,559 --> 00:11:20,159
and realized he didn't like you
that much.

202
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:23,039
Then he met the woman he was meant for.

203
00:11:23,759 --> 00:11:24,919
They're married now.

204
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:26,240
They even have a child.

205
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,279
He Jingchen.

206
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:29,960
Keep making things up.

207
00:11:35,279 --> 00:11:35,600
Su Yutang.

208
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,080
What are you doing?

209
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:40,559
Your old flame is married
with a child now.

210
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:43,799
You're the most powerful woman
in Fancheng.

211
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,559
I can't let him outdo you.

212
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,360
He Jingchen, what are you talking about?

213
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:49,679
Put me down!

214
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:51,399
Put me down right now!

215
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,000
Fine.

216
00:11:52,039 --> 00:11:53,039
I'll put you down later.

217
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:55,680
(Lancheng)

218
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,360
(My dearest Yutang,)

219
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:59,200
(Months have passed since we parted.)

220
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:01,080
(My longing deepens by the day.)

221
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:03,080
(The promise I made you)

222
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:05,200
(has never left my mind.)

223
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:07,320
(Wait for my return.)

224
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:11,600
Young Master, try it again.

225
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:13,639
Does it taste like what you had
in Fancheng?

226
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:27,480
Qing.

227
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,039
Haven't you always wanted to know

228
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:36,279
how I survived the rebellion started by
He Jingchen and Su Yutang

229
00:12:37,519 --> 00:12:39,279
and made it back alive?

230
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:40,919
It was fake.

231
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:42,320
All of it was fake, Rong Muxian.

232
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:44,159
I never had feelings for you.

233
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,120
Our relationship

234
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,679
was fake from the start.

235
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:57,039
I'm sorry.

236
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,519
(So...)

237
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,440
(they were in on it together.)

238
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:04,399
He's threatening you with my life,

239
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,279
isn't he?

240
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:09,120
When you realize that knowing too much

241
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:12,000
could get you killed,

242
00:13:14,159 --> 00:13:15,720
playing dumb

243
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:18,240
could save your life.

244
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,399
The people of Fancheng

245
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,600
and the food there

246
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:35,480
are both hard to forget.

247
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:48,160
(The End)

248
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:06,600
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

249
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:11,240
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

250
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:14,400
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

251
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:16,920
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

252
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:21,280
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

253
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:27,240
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

254
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:31,960
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

255
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:35,440
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

256
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,760
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

257
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:41,000
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

258
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:47,680
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

259
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:51,280
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

260
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:54,480
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

261
00:14:54,920 --> 00:15:01,000
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

262
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:04,400
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

263
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:07,720
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

264
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,560
♪Boundless♪
